### Documentation

* Database schema explanation
* Business questions
* KPI definitions
* SQL techniques used
* Query optimization approach
* Final business insights

---

## Completion Criteria

The project is considered complete when all technical requirements are fulfilled and the database successfully provides analytical insights for **sales, profitability, customer behavior, and business performance**.



